  "body": "If you are looking for a home that offers both modern living and tranquil privacy, this is the one you cannot miss. Tucked away in a quiet pocket of Silverdale yet close to everything, this beautiful, brand-new house is an affordable gem, making it perfect for first-home buyers or savvy investors.\r\n\r\nAs you step inside, the modern kitchen flows effortlessly into the open-plan dining and living areas, creating a warm and social heart for the home. This space connects seamlessly to the outdoor deck, which backs directly onto a lush green reserve. This private outdoor area is your own hidden oasis, perfect for quiet mornings or entertaining friends against a peaceful, natural backdrop. A separate toilet on this level adds extra practicality for visitors.\r\n\r\nUpstairs, you’ll find four well-sized bedrooms. The master bedroom serves as a private retreat with its own ensuite, while the additional three bedrooms are serviced by a family bathroom. This bathroom features a striking skylight, ensuring the space is flooded with natural light throughout the day.\r\n\r\nThe location is simply unbeatable for the modern family. You are within walking distance to the Silverdale Bus Station, just 2 minutes from the motorway for an easy commute, and only 4 minutes from the Silverdale Shopping Centre and supermarkets. Act quickly to secure this Silverdale gem, contact our agent today for a private viewing!\r\n\r\nSee interactive features for this property on barfoot.co.nz. Click the \"View office website\" link at the bottom of this page.",
